{"id": "64533", "title": "宠", "author": "宁蒙", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 24, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64533.htm", "intro": "谢谢小图给俺做地封面，你咋知道俺是足控捏。。啦啦啦~\r\n 【语言不通地文案】\r\n 江哲麟宠钟意的时候，总爱给她许多钱；如果非要他再宠一点，也不过给她许多许多的钱。\r\n 这段莫名其妙的婚姻里，钟小姐忍辱负重到濒临精神分裂，可恨江大BOSS动机不明却偏偏乐在其中。\r\n 结婚就是N夜情啊，撒花~~~~\r\n 大家不要大意的收藏俺吧，不要霸王俺这只可怜地水果受><\r\n 俺的专栏：\r\n 俺的文文：\r\n 微博：\r\n \r\n 宠预购请戳\r\n \r\n 城池已上市，请戳", "base": "files/article/html/64/64533", "chapters": [{"title": "第 1 章", "file": "9619758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 2 章", "file": "9619760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 3 章", "file": "9619762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 4 章", "file": "9619764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 5 章", "file": "9619766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 6 章", "file": "9619768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 7 章", "file": "9619770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "9619771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "9619779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "9619781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 11 章", "file": "9619784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 12 章", "file": "9619785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 13 章", "file": "9619787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 14 章", "file": "9619789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 15 章", "file": "9619791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 16 章", "file": "9619793.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 17 章", "file": "9619795.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 18 章", "file": "9619797.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 19 章", "file": "9619799.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20-24", "file": "9619801.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-29", "file": "9619802.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-34", "file": "9619803.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-39", "file": "9619804.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-44完结", "file": "9619